{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚詠麟（校長）一連五場的《譚詠麟與您「刻骨銘心」世界巡迴演唱會—終極篇》今晚（11日）在紅館正式開鑼，首場演出獲不少好友捧場，包括曾志偉、李克勤、盧淑怡、任達華、琦琦、鄺美雲、馬海倫等。當中最搶鏡的一定是城中富豪劉鑾雄，他雖然戴着口罩坐在第一行，但依然被粉絲認出，有兩位粉絲更上前邀請大劉合照，大劉亦十分友善除下口罩與粉絲合照，而劉太甘比之後亦有帶同細女入場睇騷。</p><figure><img alt=\"大劉劉鑾雄。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183807352147968809134.jpeg/BXNa8pSd6FrjKculUolm2Z3JQA_vwoJ9ndzeuJ3c3rg\"/><figcaption>大劉劉鑾雄。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183805179367424834716.jpeg/L-1XuabdEL9XDNQFUGquFj06ktVfDyFRywBsG8sAbBs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183816751845376792503.jpeg/XbKm_hTgcwqQDOz4s2xX91TTe24SdveRwZOIZ8GTiGc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183803061112832640397.jpeg/36zzeq6wh7YUHcxuOkRhpk_zHWZ5n3aTTAEu_0wBLv8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175184655284965376158964.jpeg/hcDE0huPe6CTaTq5PAGXDvsuQs4i-QQkf56Ht3-eh7c\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183810506133504691247.jpeg/LIAapWQvnUydu5CszmqEMH2xvkRPWOz6ZIBD7GSAQ-w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812532113408864057.jpeg/vZzzMUD56IHArDXzaLW1m9di7TYkFA8Uno3a9J6N2vQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183812146368512376402.jpeg/BslQ9au_k8DIRrSKKTUp364f72o3-X_mhGwaGoRsGho\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183808568233984045618.jpeg/aZNm3wrYMBHW7FJWO2x-ZNK3eWQpy9HMitteOIrbXjg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183814478532608491256.jpeg/pB1kB8VIxqOL7f1irCwqBjIRqNY8uSSCB0cuyAdHLsg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183814579064832135692.jpeg/nfTQhxrEPrw46SirhHLXtvPIRmVTngqW7LD8TOyw_Ew\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183809923256320528076.jpeg/ZByexrtCoOyp2ANXYs1PYgw8JchdvoVGKnSb3yp0m98\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183807867916288675034.jpeg/KIjHd2t_1CFIIIRVP1bLHZvZbO3ek-XIJ2pS2ydqUts\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260911/1175183805716107264918642.jpeg/bqqaum1fEEewFa0tExCxeRO2cEb1U-E55I42rOSONqw\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T12:58:16.958306+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}